review:
The original SWBF2 still has more content and gameplay features than EA's one from 2017. 
1. 64 player battles (and more with the fake console!);
2. Mountable vehicles (often with more than one place to mount, e.g. AT-TE has 3 people in it);
3. Galactic Conquest;
4. Good campaign;
5. Great mods!;
6. You can enter and destroy from the inside a capital ship in Space Assault;
7. Giving orders to team AI to follow you, move out, or to mount or dismount your vehicle.
